00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:51.559
I have a great theory on how well we all know
Kenjaku made Yuji specifically for Sukuna

00:17:51.559 --> 00:17:52.559
WELL.

00:17:52.559 --> 00:17:56.520
What if Kenjaku also made it a binding vow
that Yuji would not be able to use his CT

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:58.700
