00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:04.980
INSTANTLY A MONOLITHIC SIZED NUE IS SUMMONED
ATOP A NEARBY SKY SCRAPER.

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:09.730
With everyone reacting in pure shock and awe
