00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:59.350
SPEAKING TO GOD, SHE TELLS HIM TO PURIFY ALL,
REMOVE HIS ANGUISH TRANGRESIONS AND GULT TO

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:01.630
