00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:15.720
In another note boys and after browsing the
interwebs i've discovered that Jacob’s Ladder

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:27.840
is referring to a line from genesis 28:10-19
which narrates the story of Jacob dreaming

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:31.650
of the angels descending from the heavens
and the ladder appearing to take the souls

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:33.179
from earth to heaven.

00:20:33.179 --> 00:20:37.290
So in other words the attack simply dispels
evil while sending the persons soul on the

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:38.290
correct path.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:39.290
Jacob’s ladder could also refer to something
as simple as the Optical Phenomenon made by

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:40.290
the sunlight striking the dust particles or
haze in the sky, BUT id say it more likely

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.929
has something to do with a God type figure.

00:20:41.929 --> 00:20:45.160
INSTANTLY AS THE LIGHT BEARS DOWN ON MEGUNA,
it begins tearing at Sukuna’s soul in an

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.120
