00:21:46.309 --> 00:21:48.379
With rage filling up inside of him and if
we all the levels of cursed energy someone

00:21:48.379 --> 00:21:49.379
can produce depends on their emotions, sorcerers
are taught to n this moment and after realizing

00:21:49.379 --> 00:21:53.611
